Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:05.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}克拉克森的农场 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:10.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}第32集 酒吧老板
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:12.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（新店开张）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:23.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（银行假期周五）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:28.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（上午10点 开业前两小时）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:31.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好 杰里米 早上好 看起来怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:31.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning, Jeremy. Morning. How are we looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看起来是个酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:32.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We're looking like it's a pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.08,0:00:34.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是个酒吧 是个酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.08,0:00:34.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a pub! It's a pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.04,0:00:36.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}激动人心 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.04,0:00:36.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's exciting, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:38.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我把菜单写好了 想看看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:38.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've written your menu up. Do you want to see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:41.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好啊 有什么菜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:41.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, yeah. What have we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.28,0:00:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"鸡肝酱或压制火腿 芥末腌菜或蒜香蘑菇"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.28,0:00:45.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Chicken liver pâté or pressed ham piccalilli or garlic mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:48.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"本日特色香肠 土豆泥 豪客斯通肉汁 洋葱"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:48.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Sausages of the day, mash, Hawkstone gravy, onions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:51.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"兰开夏羊肉锅 苹果酥 本日特色芝士蛋糕"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:51.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Lancashire hotpot, apple crumble, cheesecake of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:53.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:55.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}大家早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:55.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.76,0:00:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好香啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.76,0:00:57.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh! Smelling good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.88,0:01:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好 杰里米 你好 尼克 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.88,0:01:00.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning, Jeremy. How are you? Well. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:02.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}冲刺到终点线后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:02.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}After our sprint to the finish line,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:08.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}开业日早上的氛围 平静而欢快 让人安心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:08.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}the mood on opening morning was reassuringly calm and upbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.28,0:01:10.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好 早上好 大家兴奋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.28,0:01:10.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Good morning. Morning, morning. Are we excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:12.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 当然了 非常兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:12.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, very. Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那是卷心菜煎土豆吗 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:14.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that the bubble and squeak? Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:15.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我最爱这道菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:15.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I fucking love that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:18.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}干得漂亮 非常好 好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:18.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well done. That's great. That's fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.84,0:01:20.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}大家早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.84,0:01:20.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.64,0:01:23.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}新鲜面包今早送到了 在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.64,0:01:23.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Bread's arrived this morning, fresh bread, so. There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.32,0:01:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}令人振奋 鸡蛋送来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.32,0:01:24.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Exciting. Eggs have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.16,0:01:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 一切顺利 时间刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.16,0:01:27.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, it's all coming together just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.76,0:01:28.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一直是这样 是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.76,0:01:28.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It always is. I mean, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:32.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我差点慌了手脚 瞎指挥别人"干这个 干那个"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:32.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I could have got in a blind panic and run around going: "Do this and do that,"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.56,0:01:36.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但后来我明白了 每个人都很清楚自己需要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.56,0:01:36.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but I've actually learned everybody knows what has to be done,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.76,0:01:39.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}而且现在想来 每个人都做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.76,0:01:39.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and everybody's doing a brilliant job, if you think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:39.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:44.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在我像查尔斯国王一样 巡视了一圈后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:44.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}After my King Charles' style walkabout,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（10点45分 距离开业1小时15分）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.56,0:01:50.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我和卡莱布开始了 一项我期盼已久的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.56,0:01:50.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb and I set about a job I'd been very much looking forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:51.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个插到那里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:51.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Where does that go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我昨天就没管它 太复杂了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:54.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, I didn't bother yesterday. It was too complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:57.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为酒吧洗礼 赋予它新的名称
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:57.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Christening the pub with its new name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.04,0:02:00.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（风车 烤肉店与餐厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:03.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我得从低于招牌的位置开始
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:03.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've gotta go lower than the sign to start off with
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:05.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好把它插到木头中间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:05.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause I've gotta slide it between the wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:12.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以它跟外框的尺寸不合
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:12.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So it doesn't fit in the frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:15.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}框内部分大小合适 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:15.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It fits inside the frame, but it doesn't fit...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.84,0:02:17.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}下面不合适 对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.84,0:02:17.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}At the bottom. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.56,0:02:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（农夫的狗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.24,0:02:19.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不够理想 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.24,0:02:19.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not ideal, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:21.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 但罗马不是一天建成的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:21.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I know. But Rome wasn't built in a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们把另一面也挂上去 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:23.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's put the other side up. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:28.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}前几天 丽莎发现 这个招牌有个小问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:28.18,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We had one slight problem with this, which Lisa spotted the other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:29.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:29.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.80,0:02:32.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}她说这里容易让人产生联想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.80,0:02:32.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}She says it's a bit suggestive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.08,0:02:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}也只有丽莎能看出来 真就被她看出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.08,0:02:38.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean... Only Lisa would spot that, but she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.36,0:02:39.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.36,0:02:39.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:44.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}任务圆满完成
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:44.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Job's a good 'un.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.76,0:02:48.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 还没完成 任务完成了一半 不过凑合了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.76,0:02:48.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it's not. Job's kinda half done. But it'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看起来还不错 这个招牌看起来很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:51.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It looks good, actually, doesn't it? The sign looks awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.20,0:02:53.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个招牌 我们考虑过 在"农夫的"后面加各种东西 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.20,0:02:53.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The sign is. We went through "The Farmer's" everything, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:54.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:54.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:57.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但没有什么比农夫的狗更忠诚了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:57.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But there's nothing more loyal than a farmer's dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:03:00.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你的狗是你所知道的 最忠诚的东西 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:03:00.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Your dog is the most loyal thing you'll ever know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:03.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}而你的狗 我们的狗一点都不忠诚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:03.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yours, on the other hand. Ours aren't fucking loyal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.24,0:03:06.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（在本地餐厅用餐 点一份鲜嫩的牛排 慢慢享用）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.84,0:03:07.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们将其他东西挂上了墙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.84,0:03:07.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We then hung up various other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.84,0:03:10.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我在这边 你呢 不 行了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.84,0:03:10.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm on this side. Are you? No. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:12.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}（恕不接待 基尔·斯塔默 詹姆斯·梅）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:13.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就在我们快结束的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:13.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And just as we were finishing that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.72,0:03:17.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}查理来了 并且指出了他发现的一个严重问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.72,0:03:17.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie arrived and made a rather alarming observation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.48,0:03:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.48,0:03:19.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm... What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.68,0:03:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}价格呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.68,0:03:20.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What about the prices?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:23.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}噢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:23.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.36,0:03:26.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们收多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.36,0:03:26.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What are we charging?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:29.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们还没定价吗 没人制订价格
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:29.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Have we not done that yet? Nobody's done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:31.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.76,0:03:31.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, for fuck's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:34.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}再过42分钟就要开业了 再过40分钟就要开业了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:34.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What time is it? We open in forty minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:37.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}查理赶着去解决这个问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:37.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}While Charlie hurried off to sort that out,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:41.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我的压力再度飙升
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.04,0:03:41.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}my stress levels once again shot up
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:45.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我又发现了一大堆问题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:45.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}as I started to notice a host of other problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.92,0:03:48.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}瑞秋 烤肉间去哪儿了
